Building the package
====================

    dpkg-buildpackage -us -uc -b

The result is one binary package, trigger5-dkms, which contains only the DKMS
source under /usr/src/trigger5-1.0. Installing it runs DKMS against the running
kernel's headers; the module is rebuilt automatically on kernel upgrades.

Install:

    sudo apt install ./trigger5-dkms_1.0_all.deb

or, if apt complains about the absolute path:

    sudo dpkg -i ../trigger5-dkms_1.0_all.deb
    sudo apt-get -f install

evdi is not needed: trigger5 is a standalone DRM driver.
